{
  "slug": "airwallex-dev",
  "name": "Airwallex Dev",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Build Airwallex payment integrations in your own codebase. Generates the checkout, card-element, onboarding, and subscription-billing code for an Airwallex integration and wires it into your project: Hosted Payment Page, Drop-in and Split Card elements, connected-account KYC onboarding, and Billing Hosted Checkout for subscriptions and card-saving. Also plans card-on-file merchant-initiated flows for AI providers such as top-ups and auto-recharge.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `airwallex-ai-provider-card-mit` (Use this skill to guide an end-to-end implementation plan document for card-only Airwallex Payments flows used by AI…), `airwallex-billing-checkout` (Guide integration of Airwallex Billing Hosted Checkout for subscription, one-off payment (PAYMENT), and card-saving (SETUP) scenarios), `airwallex-dropin` (Generate Airwallex Drop-in Element integration code), `airwallex-hpp` (Generate Airwallex Hosted Payment Page (HPP) integration code), `airwallex-kyc` (Generate Airwallex Connected Account KYC onboarding integration code), `airwallex-split-card` (Generate Airwallex Split Card Element integration code)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `airwallex-dev`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install airwallex-dev@claude-plugins-official` from `airwallex/airwallex-marketplace` (`plugins/airwallex-dev`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
